              '    actual: null,\n'
              '  );\n'
              '\n'
              '  /// A 503 SERVER_BUSY, held separately from `_error`.\n'
              '  ///\n'
              '  /// Not an error: the upload is fine and the server is working — someone else\n'
              '  /// is simply mid-analysis, because this instance runs one at a time (two\n'
              '  /// concurrent analyses measured 594 MB against a 512 MB limit). Rendering it\n'
              '  /// in the red error box would tell the user their file was rejected, and the\n'
              '  /// natural response to that is to go and re-export a VCF that was never wrong.\n'
              '  String? _busy;\n'
              '\n'
              '  /// What the chosen file can answer, fetched before the user commits to an\n'
